<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions</RootNamespace>

    <Title>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions — 合約交易所中立抽象層</Title>
    <Description>交易所中立的合約交易抽象層:委託、持倉、帳戶、K 線、成交等不可變模型,交易規則(tickSize/stepSize/minNotional)校正,以及 IExchangeClient / IMarketDataFeed / IUserDataFeed 介面。所有會失敗的操作一律回傳 Result&lt;T&gt;,價量金額一律 decimal,時間一律 UTC 語意的 DateTimeOffset;不含任何交易所專屬實作,可由純記憶體的回測撮合器完整實作。Exchange-neutral abstractions for derivatives trading: immutable order/position/account/kline/trade models, exchange trading-rule normalisation, and client and market-data interfaces. Every fallible operation returns Result&lt;T&gt;; no exchange-specific code, so an in-memory backtest engine can implement it end to end.</Description>
    <PackageTags>ozakboy;tradekit;trading;futures;perpetual;exchange;abstractions;backtest;order;position;kline;decimal;tick-size;step-size;result-type;dotnet;csharp</PackageTags>

    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions</RepositoryUrl>

    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>

    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.3.0 — Breaking: AccountUpdate.Positions/Balances and MarginCall.Positions now use PositionChange, BalanceChange and MarginCallPosition, which carry only what the exchange event delivers. The previous full Position/Balance values had to zero the missing fields, and Position.Notional (quantity × mark price) was therefore always zero on account updates — read by a risk check as no exposure. The changed properties arrived in 0.2.0 the day before with no known consumer. Full notes: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions 已發佈到 nuget.org,改以 PackageReference 引用。
    先前是指向本機絕對路徑的 ProjectReference,那讓這個 repo 只能在該路徑存在的機器上建置:
    CI 與其他開發者都還原不到,而且 Release 建置會鏈到對方的 Debug 組件
    —— Configuration 不會流經 sln 外部的專案參照。
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions" Version="0.3.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    刻意不引用 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 套件。
    自 .NET 8 起 SourceLink 已內建於 SDK,只要設定 PublishRepositoryUrl 與 EmbedUntrackedSources
    (見 Directory.Build.props)即可產生原始碼連結;外掛套件反而會帶進額外的相依鏈。
  -->

</Project>
